{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the last (rightmost) digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e638b66585caa5203429fd450c51746832aa26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2006}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that the last digits of powers have a pattern with exponents. In particular:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/0/580ea360f95ef9fa75923756d9e08a0719dfe5de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 3^1 &amp;\\equiv 3 \\pmod{10}\\\\ 3^2 &amp;\\equiv 9 \\pmod{10}\\\\ 3^3 &amp;\\equiv 7 \\pmod{10}\\\\ 3^4 &amp;\\equiv 1 \\pmod{10}\\\\ 3^5 &amp;\\equiv 3 \\pmod{10} \\end{align*}\" width=\"139\" height=\"130\" />\nFrom the pattern, the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c404d8a8901ace9c02b39cb10d8dd226134c19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> depends on the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is divided by 4.  The remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the last digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e638b66585caa5203429fd450c51746832aa26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2006}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/374ad4e9adc96666cde62dd31911b54d38e83c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/4/674c3e64e3edf1ad22eaf8d166194ceb1a99ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\phi(m)} \\pmod m \\equiv 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"23\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a6104325ba4b7582c1afed3d5be3f1c372e8781e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,m) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f8dd9d5888177acce62ce00139ab4e99af5e35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^4 \\pmod {10} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cdcd2340ca8309a61edd06b91832ddb290e94a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2004} \\pmod {10} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"21\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e638b66585caa5203429fd450c51746832aa26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2006}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c9624331765cd3a70e19c0076e51087682f4af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/374ad4e9adc96666cde62dd31911b54d38e83c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Pr